  <History Date="27-11-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised col preset and chase ranges in line with manual v.3.2 (12/16/2014) in response to customer bug report." />
  <History Date="27-11-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Moved chase controls into effect group and wheel slots.  Moved pan and tilt spin controls into beam." />
  <History Date="27-11-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised colour macro to variable range" />
  <History Date="22-03-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed name from Magic Panel 602 to MagicPanel 602" />
  <History Date="23-03-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Standardised across product range." />
  <History Date="31-03-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added vdim to Extended mode cells.  Standardised Col Preset function names across product range." />
  <History Date="25-04-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added RDM ID in response to details from manufacturer" />
